;; Upstream provenance catalog — which external source each part of this
;; repo mirrors, with the URL that was actually fetched.
;;
;; langchain-store is "shared machinery for langchain.db-backed actor
;; stores" (README). Everything here is a store-seam commonalization over
;; a Datomic-API-compatible EAV plane, so the upstream documents this file
;; pins are the ones the code actually rests on: the langchain.db provider
;; it is built on, the Datomic client-API function-map contract that
;; langchain.db exposes, the in-memory DataScript db that drops into the
;; same api map, and the EDN codec format its blob store serializes.
;;
;; Discipline (enforced by test/langchain_store/catalog_test.cljk):
;;   - :url was fetched on :verified and the FINAL response was :http
;;     (redirect-resolved — a URL that only answers via a chain of 301s
;;     is recorded at its terminal address, not its historical one).
;;   - :mirrors are file paths in this repo, and they must exist.
;;   - URLs are distinct — the same source listed twice is padding,
;;     not two citations.
;;
;; 2026-09-09 increment: the DataScript row gains the concrete function
;; names its subject line names — db/q, db/transact!, db/pull,
;; db/entity, db/datoms — each read from DataScript's own API docs
;; (docs/cheatsheet + datascript.core public vars) rather than assumed
;; from the Datomic page. The datomic.client.api row is likewise pinned
;; to a measured var list (administer-system as-of client connect
;; create-database datoms db db-stats delete-database history index-pull
;; index-range list-databases pull q qseq rseek-datoms seek-datoms since
;; sync transact tx-range with with-db) rather than the four names in the
;; subject text. Both measured live on 2026-09-09.
{:catalog/id :langchain-store/upstream-provenance
 :catalog/verified "2026-09-09"
 :catalog/sources
 [{:subject "kotoba-lang/langchain — the only dependency, providing langchain.db (a Datomic-API-compatible EAV store + Datalog + pull, swappable to a kotoba-server pod)"
   :mirrors ["deps.edn" "README.md" "src/langchain_store/core.cljk"]
   :url "https://github.com/kotoba-lang/langchain"
   :http 200 :verified "2026-09-09"}

  {:subject "Datomic client API — the function-map contract (d/db, d/q, d/transact!, d/pull) that langchain.db exposes and every store helper here writes through"
   :mirrors ["README.md" "src/langchain_store/core.cljk"]
   :url "https://docs.datomic.com/client-api/datomic.client.api.html"
   :http 200 :verified "2026-09-09"
   :measured/vars ["administer-system" "as-of" "client" "connect" "create-database" "datoms" "db" "db-stats" "delete-database" "history" "index-pull" "index-range" "list-databases" "pull" "q" "qseq" "rseek-datoms" "seek-datoms" "since" "sync" "transact" "tx-range" "with" "with-db"]
